sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>Browser
    participant Dashboard as RHOAI Dashboard
    participant Controller as odh-notebook-controller
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OAuth as OAuth Proxy Sidecar<br/>TLS Termination
    participant JupyterLab as JupyterLab<br/>8888/TCP HTTP
    participant CodeServer as nginx → code-server<br/>8787/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,S3: Workbench Creation Flow

    User->>Dashboard: Select notebook image & config
    Dashboard->>Controller: Create Notebook CR
    Controller->>Controller: Inject OAuth proxy sidecar
    Controller->>Controller: Set NB_PREFIX, NOTEBOOK_ARGS env vars
    Controller->>JupyterLab: Create workbench pod<br/>(start-notebook.sh entrypoint)

    Note over User,S3: JupyterLab User Access Flow

    User->>Route: HTTPS request
    Route->>OAuth: Forward request
    OAuth->>OAuth: Validate user identity<br/>(OpenShift OAuth)
    OAuth->>JupyterLab: Forward authenticated request<br/>HTTP/8888
    JupyterLab-->>OAuth: Response
    OAuth-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>User: Notebook UI

    Note over User,S3: Code-Server User Access Flow

    User->>Route: HTTPS request
    Route->>OAuth: Forward request
    OAuth->>OAuth: Validate user identity
    OAuth->>CodeServer: Forward via NB_PREFIX path<br/>HTTP/8787
    CodeServer-->>OAuth: Response
    OAuth-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>User: Code-Server IDE

    Note over User,S3: User Workload Data Access (Optional)

    JupyterLab->>K8sAPI: kubernetes Python client<br/>HTTPS/443 (TLS)
    K8sAPI-->>JupyterLab: Cluster resources
    JupyterLab->>S3: boto3 / minio client<br/>HTTPS/443 (TLS)
    S3-->>JupyterLab: Data / model artifacts

    Note over User,S3: Platform Configuration Injection

    Controller->>JupyterLab: NB_PREFIX → ServerApp.base_url
    Controller->>JupyterLab: NOTEBOOK_ARGS → server config
    Controller->>CodeServer: NB_PREFIX → nginx location block
